title    The Devil's Bridge Mazurka
composer ChatGPT
about    The villagers dance a bargain they have no intention of keeping. A goat waits by the door.
tempo    116
beats    3
steps    2
swing    0
reverb   0.18

voice fiddle violin vol=0.92 pan=-0.15 rev=0.22 gate=0.87
voice reply  clarinet vol=0.46 pan=0.24 rev=0.2 gate=0.84
voice box    schwyzeroergeli vol=0.5 pan=0.12 rev=0.16 gate=0.46 center=D4
voice bass   upright vol=0.72 pan=0 rev=0.1 gate=0.8

pattern intro
fiddle  | D5- A5!- F5- | E5- A5!- C#6- | D6-- C6 Bb5 A5 | G5- E5!- C#5- |
box     | .- [Dm]!- [Dm]- | .- [A7]!- [A7]- | .- [Dm]!- [Dm]- | .- [A7]!- [A7]- |
bass    | D2- A2!- D3- | A1- E2!- A2- | D2- A2!- D3- | A1- E2!- A2- |

pattern A
fiddle  | D5-- F5 A5- | G5- E5!- C#5- | D5 F5 A5- D6- | C#6-- Bb5 A5- |
